{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44142","headline":"酬人雨後翫竹 · 薛涛","name":"酬人雨後翫竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南天春雨时，那鉴雪霜姿。\n衆类亦云茂，虚心能自持。\n多留晋贤醉，早伴舜妃悲。\n晚岁君能赏，苍苍劲节奇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛涛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44142.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44142","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}